WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:02.510
To the rhythm!

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:05.480
Check it!

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:10.660
OK, fellas!

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.880
Yeah yeah party people
let's go let's turn it up

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.750
Let's rush in let's send it flying
let's attack let's dash

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.420
The battlefields are sacred,
Bakuretsu Tenshi, Crazy Burst Angel

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:41.320
They're a bother, they're cheeky,
come on, blast 'em good!

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.500
Everybody, loosey

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.200
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.540
Vividly, crazy

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.040
Fly up, angel

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.340
We are the risma so charisma

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:00.380
We soar, really prisma (bomber)

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.910
Hey! It's danceable OK
shake it right now let's go

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.720
Gutsiness let's go beat
let's ride the rhythm tension

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.350
It goes flying frustration

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:11.460
Alright let's go let's get it on
loosey beauty get your body

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.960
Everybody, loosey

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:18.460
Be in full bloom, bluesy

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:21.870
Vividly, crazy

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:25.700
Fly up, angel

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.610
How are you feeling, Jo?

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.240
You again?!

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.390
Why do you have Meg...?!

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:25.060
She'll only do what I say now.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:27.890
Did <i>she</i> say that?!

00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:30.690
She will soon.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:39.340
I'm sure of it,
once she sees me kill you...

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.880
Don't screw with me.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:50.510
You know my location.
I'll be waiting for you.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:57.150
I'm coming, Meg...!

00:03:00.430 --> 00:03:06.340
I can't wait. Once I tear
her to shreds, you'll be..

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:08.500
That's not true...

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:14.680
I can't eat any more...

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:17.840
This is Jo's food...

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:47.040
<i>I'll play with you guys too
until she gets here</i>.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:12.340
The Guard Cybots onboard have activated.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:14.670
Maria is controlling them.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:19.940
Professor. Why isn't Maria
starting the fight herself?

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:26.710
Think about why she chose the Moon
Empire for her fight with Jo...

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:33.160
Most likely, she wants to
recreate that final test.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:36.990
Could it be due to memory-related trauma?

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:39.300
There is that...

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:42.970
...but not only has Jo lost her
memory, but she also possesses

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.940
a hidden and unknown power.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:51.740
Having instinctually inferred this,
Maria wants to restore Jo's memory

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:55.080
and make her remember how strong she is.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.980
She likely believes that when
she proves her supremacy,

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:03.080
Jo's mind and body will be
completely destroyed.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:08.690
Maria is aware of the danger
of clashing with Jo head-on.

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:15.030
However, she feels no fear toward anyone.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:20.500
She is simply making extremely
calm and strategic decisions.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:25.200
Exactly as our Genocide
Angel was designed to do.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.830
Attention, citizens of Tokyo.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.730
Should you ever leave the city,
be sure to always carry

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:12.030
your RAPT-issued Citizen
Registration Card with you.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:17.370
Non-citizens of Tokyo require
a City Residence License.

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:22.900
If asked for your permits, follow
the officer's instructions promptly.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:28.780
Evaluations for firearm license
applications have also been revised.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:32.620
Those wishing to carry firearms
will be required to pass

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.060
prescribed tests of physical
abilities and intelligence.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:44.630
Last night, RAPT mobile units
conducted peace-purification patrols,

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.730
resulting in 198 criminal arrests.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:07:00.150
To increase the results of these patrols,
RAPT's PR section advises against

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:05.640
going outside or conducting
business at nighttime.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:10.060
The Tokyo Reconstruction
Committee plans to begin a list

00:07:10.060 --> 00:07:15.260
of illegal homes, businesses, and groups
with an investigation this month.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:21.900
This is meant to sort out and isolate
the UGP, or Underground People,

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:24.910
who are bent on hindering
the city's development.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:29.900
The list will be drawn up as recommended
by international sociologists.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:33.820
At a conference today,
the city of Tokyo announced

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:37.690
an ordinance requiring all
residents-  including foreigners-

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:40.160
to have regular medical checks.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:43.190
Violators will be located and punished

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:45.350
by the RAPT Environmental
Preservation Section.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:56.600
We now have 100% control
over all media outlets.

00:07:56.600 --> 00:08:01.710
Broadcast video can also be
modified and edited as we wish.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:06.180
Excellent. Then I have something
for you to do right away.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:09.520
Maria has stolen control
of the Moon Empire.

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:12.720
Don't let word get out until
the situation is under control.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:15.520
Understood. I'll arrange it at once.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.170
What is the situation?

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.200
Mr. Glenford.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:30.760
A change not even we could predict
is on the verge of happening.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:38.840
Maria, of her own will, has taken
action to obtain something she wants.

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:44.640
What desires could an Angel
created as a combat life form have?

00:08:45.490 --> 00:08:49.760
They're just weapons in human form.

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:55.590
We designed their bodies
and programmed each and every cell.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:02.800
They have no fear of death
or joy of being alive.

00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:07.870
All they do have is a combat
system to attack and destroy.

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:44.810
The fusion of machine-like accuracy
and beast-like fighting instincts...

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:48.610
That's what we intended the Angels to be...

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:56.690
...but they also couldn't escape
from the fact that they were human.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:01.460
The desire to seek out stronger enemies

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:06.020
and feel happiness by destroying them...

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:26.920
When she experiences the taste
of victory at its most extreme state,

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:30.690
Maria may achieve
an even greater evolution...

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:34.500
And if she loses...?

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:39.560
She will likely lose her
identity as a combat life form

00:10:40.470 --> 00:10:43.930
and choose to take her own life...

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:40.330
Where are we?

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.360
The ocean?

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:46.460
Nobody can interfere out here.

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.600
Why did we come here...?!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:00.440
Where's Jo?!

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:04.120
Somewhere on board, I guess.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.850
You guess?!

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:09.220
I will slaughter her here.

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:13.680
Once I do that, you'll be mine, right, Meg?

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.230
"M-M-Meg?!"

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:19.470
How dare you leave off my name suffix!

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:22.490
And besides, Jo'd never lose to you!

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.800
What're you doing...?

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:34.020
You may think you've got me hostage,

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:37.020
but that won't work on Jo!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:39.820
You're the one who's gonna get slaughtered!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:46.490
Why? I'm stronger than she is, and yet...

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:50.730
...I don't understand why..

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.520
--you rely on Jo!

00:12:56.070 --> 00:12:57.470
Eep...!

00:12:58.140 --> 00:12:59.770
Ow...!

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:02.110
Let go of me!

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.580
I've changed my mind.

00:13:04.580 --> 00:13:07.980
I will kill Jo right now!

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:12.150
And then you, too.

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:19.390
What did you..

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:24.130
You're weak and adorable... But...

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:27.170
...if you'll only ever be hers...

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:29.200
...then I don't need you.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:33.240
<i>I can't move</i>...

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:36.230
Be a good little girl for a while.

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:59.160
She's coming!

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:09.440
The two are converging in Hangar #1!

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.880
Maria! You mustn't fight there!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.860
These are all..

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.930
She's here!

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:20.210
Couldn't wait anymore, huh?

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.850
I'll kill you!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.250
Right now!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:35.360
Maria's Combat Neuron Activation
Index is increasing abnormally!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.730
Her synapses won't hold if this keeps up!

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:43.170
No wonder Angels were forbidden
from fighting each other...

00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:52.850
It's no use!

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.910
Yeah! I know...!

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:08.750
Can't we stop them from fighting somehow?

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:13.030
Even our enforcement
program is being blocked.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:16.970
There is no way to stop
them until they finish.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:21.210
Can't we regain control of the Moon Empire?

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:25.950
The Moon Empire is a Metal
Brain-based, unmanned aircraft carrier.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:29.550
It's presently under
Maria's complete control.

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:35.580
That doesn't include the new-model
cybots on board, though...

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:50.300
<i>I win!</i>

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.150
What on earth...?!

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:36.710
Maria's Combat Neurons have disappeared...!

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:46.860
What's happened to me?

00:17:47.800 --> 00:17:53.130
I don't know why... but I don't
want to fight you anymore...

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:57.070
Same here... I'm at my limit...

00:17:57.070 --> 00:18:01.010
Wait! Why are you stopping?!

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:04.650
Because you don't want to fight...

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.920
This doesn't make sense...

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.650
I can't comprehend
why I don't want to fight...

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:14.260
This never happened before...!

00:18:14.260 --> 00:18:17.590
What do I do...?!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:25.960
Jo!

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:30.910
A perfect being that feels no fear...

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:34.510
Wasn't that what a
Genocide Angel was to be?

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.750
No matter the circumstances,
those born as humans

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.510
cannot overcome their humanity...

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:45.710
At least, the gods didn't
allow it this time...

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:49.490
Professor! It's too early
for conclusions...!

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:53.690
Most surprising of all is the
level of Jo's latent abilities,

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:56.990
which surpassed even Maria's programming.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:03.200
The more Jo fights, the more her
combat abilities are drawn out.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:07.900
All to save that girl partner of hers...

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:17.650
<i>Jo</i>... <i>Don't lose</i>...

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.460
Jo... lost?!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:31.990
T-That's not possible...!

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:37.640
Jo! Come on, now!

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:41.170
Don't die, Jo! Say something!

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:45.480
--Jo isn't dead.
--Damn you...!

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:48.880
How could you...! Give her back!

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:51.320
It's all right, Meg.

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:57.090
She used too much energy
fighting me. But don't worry.

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.650
Her neuro-program reset has begun.

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:06.330
I thought you were Jo's enemy...?

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.900
Not anymore.

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:11.670
I want Jo to live.

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:13.710
Because I like her.

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:15.900
Huh...?

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:24.350
Maria! Obey our orders
and under go reprogramming!

00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:27.980
Continue to ignore them and
you will be disposed of!

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:30.290
Respond! Maria!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:35.350
No! I won't be reprogrammed!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:43.300
By saying that, you've
asked to be executed!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:46.500
Do it!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:18.500
Meg! Take Jo and jump
into the ocean! Hurry!

00:21:28.020 --> 00:21:29.920
Maria!

00:21:56.740 --> 00:22:04.410
I remained motionless within the crowd

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:12.050
Not even the voice of my
tears carried on this street

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:19.760
as my feelings of lonesomeness joined it

00:22:19.760 --> 00:22:29.130
In truth, everyone wants
to smile with each other,

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:35.440
yet they get hurt
when they can't do it very well

00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:44.550
But someone will always
be there to watch,

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:51.750
so let's walk together
beneath this sky

00:23:12.910 --> 00:23:16.050
<i>The angel's last mission
begins in this world's Hell,</i>

00:23:16.050 --> 00:23:19.020
<i>which is controlled by an immense evil!</i>

00:23:19.480 --> 00:23:25.650
<i>On the next Burst Angel:</i>
"Burst, Angels!"
